scenario: HW-ID-01
title: This computer page
area: Hardware
rows: F-HW-05, F-HW-04
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: Signed in as an administrator.
step: Open Settings, This computer.
expect: The page shows a label, the number of boots, first and last seen, and the model read from the computer.
clause: F-HW-05.facts
step: Change the label and press Save.
expect: The label is kept after you leave and come back.
clause: F-HW-05.label
step: Compare the model on the page with the sticker or the box.
expect: They agree (or the page says unknown without guessing).
clause: F-HW-04.model
